HST Office: File view polish, and no upstream language sample templates.

- extras/Package_templates.mk: upstream's Japanese and Simplified Chinese sample templates are not installed. They appeared
  in the File view gallery, the Start Center and the Templates dialog (the Chinese one names LibreOffice) while Asian text
  is hidden by default; they do not return when it is enabled. Nothing depends on them.
- File view gallery: its own small view class with the colours of the page; TemplateDefaultView keeps the Start Center's
  configured background.
- Left column: a hover highlight drawn into the custom button image, which covers the theme's own.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-backstage-flows.py.
